  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Hardened UDP Transport: Optimized sequence ID parsing and advanced sliding window logic for robust anti-replay protection.\n- Enhanced Security: Integrated HMAC integrity checks and timestamp validation directly into the UDP listener pipeline.\n- Intelligent Traffic Control: Introduced adaptive throttling with Token Bucket and Policy-based rate limiters to protect against traffic bursts.\n- Scalable Observability: Expanded shard telemetry and real-time queue depth monitoring for complex distributed deployments.\n- High-Performance Dispatch: Seamless integration with the new Weighted Round-Robin dispatcher for fair packet processing.",
